# play workflow-step/user-manage-sudo-confirmation -------------$
$
# [i] Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the gallery's$
# fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes: the simulated$
# system only records each step it would apply, and the record$
# is shown when play ends.$
# The workflow plays its normal sequence.$
# Step 2 of each plan applied fails, where the plan has a step 2$
# (-fail 2), and the steps before it are rolled back.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
  hardn > User Management > Manage User$
$
  Managing sudo method for: [george]$
$
# [*] Warning$
# A user password is required for sudo usage.$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Sudo Method          Password required$
$
   -  Require george's password for sudo$
      /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
      @@ -1 +1 @@$
      -george ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL$
      +george ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL$
      $ visudo -cf /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
$
   -  Check the sudo configuration$
      $ visudo -c$
$
  Require password for sudo? [y/N, 0, b or q]: y$
$
  [+] Done: Require george's password for sudo$
  [!] Failed: Check the sudo configuration (exit status 1)$
$
# [!] Operation Failed$
# Step 2 failed: exit status 1$
$
  [<] Rolled back: Require george's password for sudo$
$
      $ visudo -c$
$
  [i] Info: The gallery failed this step, as -fail asked;$
      nothing on this machine changed.$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# [i] Info: user-manage-sudo-confirmation, normal$
# Recorded, not done: the file each step would write or restore,$
# and the commands it would run.$
$
   -  Applied: Require george's password for sudo$
      /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
      $ visudo -cf /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
$
   -  Failed: Check the sudo configuration (exit status 1)$
$
   -  Rolled back: Require george's password for sudo$
      /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
$

